%% Title: Delta Lake Write Sequence (Silver Layer)
%% Covers: RULES.md §2.1 (Silver Layer), §2.5 (ACID via Delta Lake), silver writer orchestration
%% Updated: 2026-03-24
%% Components: BatchProcessingService, SilverWriter, validation/Arrow prep, Delta dispatch, merge resilience, metadata finalization

%% @version 1.1.0
%% @date    2026-03-24
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   Mixed (System / Component / Class)
%% @nodes   7
%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'lineWidth': '2'}}}%%
%% @uniform sequence width=184 max_title_len=18
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Processing as BatchProcessingService
    participant Writer as SilverWriter
    participant Validate as Validation + Arrow prep
    participant Dispatch as Delta dispatch policy
    participant Delta as DeltaTable / write_deltalake
    participant Storage as Delta log + parquet files
    participant Metadata as Silver metadata finalization

    Note over Processing,Writer: Phase 1: Silver stage entry

    Processing->>Writer: write_silver(table_name, records, primary_keys, schema, mode)
    activate Writer
    Writer->>Writer: execute_silver_write_with_tracing(...)

    Note over Writer,Validate: Phase 2: Validate and prepare payload

    Writer->>Validate: _prepare_silver_write_payload(...)
    activate Validate
    Note right of Validate: Validate write mode and keys<br/>Deduplicate primary keys<br/>Run Pandera + schema drift policy<br/>Build Arrow table
    Validate-->>Writer: Prepared payload
    deactivate Validate

    Note over Writer,Delta: Phase 3: Dispatch by mode

    Writer->>Dispatch: _dispatch_write_with_domain_errors(table_name, request)
    activate Dispatch

    alt mode == merge
        Dispatch->>Delta: load DeltaTable(table_path)
        activate Delta
        Delta->>Storage: read _delta_log
        Storage-->>Delta: current table snapshot
        Delta->>Delta: merge(source, predicate by primary keys)
        Delta->>Storage: write parquet files
        Delta->>Storage: append new _delta_log version
        Storage-->>Delta: commit complete
        Delta-->>Dispatch: merge applied
        deactivate Delta
    else mode == append / delete
        Dispatch->>Delta: write_deltalake(mode=append/overwrite)
        activate Delta
        Delta->>Storage: write parquet + delta log updates
        Storage-->>Delta: commit complete
        Delta-->>Dispatch: write applied
        deactivate Delta
    end

    Dispatch-->>Writer: write dispatched
    deactivate Dispatch

    Note over Writer,Metadata: Phase 4: Metadata and result assembly

    Writer->>Metadata: _complete_silver_write_pipeline(ctx, payload)
    activate Metadata
    Metadata->>Storage: read current Delta version
    Metadata->>Storage: write Silver metadata sidecar
    Metadata-->>Writer: SilverWriteResult
    deactivate Metadata

    Writer-->>Processing: SilverWriteResult
    deactivate Writer

    rect rgb(255, 250, 205)
        Note over Writer,Delta: Resilience semantics
        Note right of Delta: Merge path uses timeout + retry helpers.<br/>Schema/Delta errors are translated to domain write errors.<br/>No separate lock-validation step is modeled here.
    end
